## 🚀 Getting Started

### Prerequisites
- Google Colab account (recommended) or Jupyter Notebook installed locally
- Python 3.7+
- Required libraries: pandas, numpy, matplotlib, seaborn, pytz

### Installation

#### Option 1: Google Colab (Recommended)
```bash
1. Go to https://colab.research.google.com/
2. Click "Upload" → Select the Play_Store_Analysis.ipynb file
3. Follow the prompts to run each cell
```

#### Option 2: Local Machine
```bash
# Clone or download the notebook
# Install required packages
pip install pandas numpy matplotlib seaborn pytz

# Launch Jupyter
jupyter notebook Play_Store_Analysis.ipynb
```

