## 🎨 Chart Customization

To modify the chart appearance, edit these variables in **Step 8**:

```python
# Colors
color_rating = '#2E86AB'      # Blue bars (average rating)
color_reviews = '#A23B72'     # Purple bars (review count)

# Chart dimensions
fig_width = 14
fig_height = 7

# Bar width and spacing
width = 0.35                   # Distance between bars

# Y-axis range
ax.set_ylim(0, 5.5)           # Maximum value on y-axis

# Font sizes
fontsize_title = 14
fontsize_label = 12
fontsize_value = 8
```

